{"case_id": "m16", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Geometry of Straight Lines"], "output": "Let the unknown angle be $x$.\n\n$x + 125^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$  \n*(Angles on a straight line)*\n\n$x = 180^{\\circ} - 125^{\\circ}$\n\n$x = 55^{\\circ}$\n\n**Answer:** $55^{\\circ}$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 7.373, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 481, "output_tokens": 1090, "reasoning_tokens": 1008, "cost_usd": 0.001495, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:37"}
{"case_id": "m07", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Exponents"], "output": "**WORKED SOLUTION**\n\n$$ \\begin{aligned} &\\text{Calculate: } 2^3 \\times 2^2 \\\\[10pt] &\\text{Step 1: Expand the powers according to their definition.} \\\\ &2^3 = 2 \\times 2 \\times 2 = 8 \\\\ &2^2 = 2 \\times 2 = 4 \\\\[10pt] &\\text{Step 2: Substitute the values back into the expression.} \\\\ &= 8 \\times 4 \\\\[10pt] &\\text{Step 3: Perform the multiplication.} \\\\ &= 32 \\\\[10pt] &\\textbf{Answer: } 32 \\end{aligned} $$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 9.945, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 434, "output_tokens": 1542, "reasoning_tokens": 1373, "cost_usd": 0.002075, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:40"}
{"case_id": "m46", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Finance, growth and decay", "grade12"], "output": "**FORMULA:**\n$$A = P(1 + i)^n$$\n\n**GIVEN:**\n$P = 20\\,000$\n$i = \\frac{9\\%}{12} = 0.0075$\n$n = 5 \\times 12 = 60$\n\n**SUBSTITUTION:**\n$$A = 20\\,000(1 + 0.0075)^{60}$$\n$$A = 20\\,000(1.0075)^{60}$$\n\n**CALCULATION:**\n$$A = 20\\,000(1.565681\\dots)$$\n$$A = 31\\,313.6205\\dots$$\n\n**ANSWER:**\nThe value after 5 years is **R31 313.62**.", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 8.055, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 436, "output_tokens": 1307, "reasoning_tokens": 1096, "cost_usd": 0.00177, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:45"}
{"case_id": "m11", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Common Fractions"], "output": "$$ \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{3} $$\n\n**Finding the Lowest Common Denominator (LCD)**\n$\\text{LCD of } 4 \\text{ and } 3 = 12$\n\n**Adjusting the fractions**\n$$ = \\frac{3 \\times 3}{4 \\times 3} + \\frac{2 \\times 4}{3 \\times 4} $$\n$$ = \\frac{9}{12} + \\frac{8}{12} $$\n\n**Adding the numerators**\n$$ = \\frac{9 + 8}{12} $$\n$$ = \\frac{17}{12} $$\n\n**Converting to a mixed number**\n$$ \\frac{17}{12} = \\frac{12}{12} + \\frac{5}{12} = 1 \\frac{5}{12} $$\n\n**FINAL ANSWER**\n$$ 1 \\frac{5}{12} $$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 18.853, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 508, "output_tokens": 3121, "reasoning_tokens": 2899, "cost_usd": 0.00414, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:49"}
{"case_id": "m13", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "truncated", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Decimal Fractions"], "output": "", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 22.548, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 493, "output_tokens": 2000, "reasoning_tokens": 2000, "cost_usd": 0.002074, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Parasail"], "finish_reasons": ["length"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:52"}
{"case_id": "m54", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Differential calculus", "grade12"], "output": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x) &= 3x^4 - 2x^2 + 5x \\\\[1em]\nf'(x) &= \\frac{d}{dx}(3x^4) - \\frac{d}{dx}(2x^2) + \\frac{d}{dx}(5x) & [\\text{Differentiate term by term}] \\\\[1em]\n&= 4(3x^{4-1}) - 2(2x^{2-1}) + 1(5x^{1-1}) & [\\text{Apply power rule: } f'(x) = nax^{n-1}] \\\\[1em]\n&= 12x^3 - 4x^1 + 5(1) & [\\text{Simplify}] \\\\[1em]\nf'(x) &= 12x^3 - 4x + 5\n\\end{aligned}\n$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 6.709, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 434, "output_tokens": 1130, "reasoning_tokens": 915, "cost_usd": 0.00154, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:08:55"}
